  May 24\, 1995) \, and \nthen seeking judicial review in the Superior Cour
 t \, see 5 M.R.S. §§ 1825- F\, \n11001(1) (2026)\; M.R. Civ. P. 80C.  We
  recently rejected a challenge by Waldo \nCommunity Action Partners (Waldo
  CAP) to the award for Region 5\, see Waldo \nCmty. Action Partners v. Dep
 ’t of Admin. & Fin. Servs. ( Waldo CAP)\, 2026 ME 13\, \n¶¶ 18\, 40\, 
 354 A.3d 319\, and we now address a challenge by Penquis C.A.P.\, Inc. \n(
 Penquis CAP) \, to the awards for Regions 2\, 3\, 4\, and 8.  For the reas
 ons \nexplained below\, we affirm the judgment of the Business and Consume
 r Docket \n(McKeon\, J.) upholdi\nhttps://www.courts.maine.gov/courts/sjc/
